    "detailed_description": "Join the Y0L0 Space Hacker Agency, an ethical hacker organisation.<br>Your first mission: hack into a space station and unravel its mystery.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What Happened On Bikini-72? </h2>   - Explore a 3d Adventure Game<br>   - Solve puzzles based on real security breaches<br>   - Crack passwords<br>   - Intercept and temper with web requests<br>   - Get passed servers security<br>   - All of this in a secure environment to learn and improve your skills<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Real hacking tools</h2>Use the hacker tools integrated into the game: a terminal, a web proxy, nmap to scan the network, dirb for brute-force attacks on websites, password lists to force authentication, John to crack passwords, reverse shells, privilege escalation techniques...<br><br>Once the flaw is found, run a Reverse Shell and get Admin.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Where to start?</h2>- You know nothing about cybersecurity? That's fine, we're set to tell you everything you need to know! <br>We have prepared a comprehensive Cyber-security tutorial for beginners. <br>Complete missions, to learn step by step the various techniques used by hackers. You'll probably have to use your brain a little bit, but you'll never get stuck.<br><br>- You already know the basics of Linux machines and a bit of programming? That's great, it's going to get really interesting!",
    "about_the_game": "Join the Y0L0 Space Hacker Agency, an ethical hacker organisation.<br>Your first mission: hack into a space station and unravel its mystery.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What Happened On Bikini-72? </h2>   - Explore a 3d Adventure Game<br>   - Solve puzzles based on real security breaches<br>   - Crack passwords<br>   - Intercept and temper with web requests<br>   - Get passed servers security<br>   - All of this in a secure environment to learn and improve your skills<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Real hacking tools</h2>Use the hacker tools integrated into the game: a terminal, a web proxy, nmap to scan the network, dirb for brute-force attacks on websites, password lists to force authentication, John to crack passwords, reverse shells, privilege escalation techniques...<br><br>Once the flaw is found, run a Reverse Shell and get Admin.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Where to start?</h2>- You know nothing about cybersecurity? That's fine, we're set to tell you everything you need to know! <br>We have prepared a comprehensive Cyber-security tutorial for beginners. <br>Complete missions, to learn step by step the various techniques used by hackers. You'll probably have to use your brain a little bit, but you'll never get stuck.<br><br>- You already know the basics of Linux machines and a bit of programming? That's great, it's going to get really interesting!",
    "short_description": "Welcome to our ethical hacker's organisation: we will teach you how to use actual hacker tools (terminal, proxy, reverse shells...) to scan the network, crack passwords, bypass server security and solve the mystery of the Bikini-72 space station.",
